  {
   "text": "The Wilds of Eldraine Commander decks are released together with Wilds of Eldraine . These are meant to be on-ramps to Commander , with a few new cards and the rest reprints.",
   "scene": 0,
   "section": ""
  },
  {
   "text": "Wilds of Eldraine Commander cards with the WOC set code and numbered 1–28 (and their alternate versions numbered 29–56) are permitted in the Commander, Legacy, and Vintage formats. Cards with the WOC set code numbered 59 and above are legal for play in any format where a card with the same name is permitted.",
   "scene": 1,
   "section": "Description"
  },
  {
   "text": "Each package contains:",
   "scene": 2,
   "section": "Contents"
  },
  {
   "text": "1 Display Commander card",
   "scene": 2,
   "section": "Contents"
  },
  {
   "text": "2 additional foil Legendary cards",
   "scene": 2,
   "section": "Contents"
  },
  {
   "text": "10 double-sided tokens",
   "scene": 2,
   "section": "Contents"
  },
  {
   "text": "1 Collector Booster Sample Pack (2 cards)",
   "scene": 2,
   "section": "Contents"
  },
  {
   "text": "Reprints with new art are: Secluded Glen , Pollenbright Wings , Mantle of the Ancients and Kor Spiritdancer .",
   "scene": 2,
   "section": "Contents"
  },
  {
   "text": "Eight additional cards with the WOC code (#21/28 to #28/28) can only be found in the Set and Collector Boosters. They aren't found in the Wilds of Eldraine Commander decks. Five of these form the Court cycle.",
   "scene": 3,
   "section": "Cycles and additional cards"
  },
  {
   "text": "The last three additional cards are a rare Throne of Eldraine and two mythics, Brenard, Ginger Sculptor and Korvold, Gleeful Glutton .",
   "scene": 3,
   "section": "Cycles and additional cards"
  },
  {
   "text": "The 3/1 Knight creature token for Court of Embereth was not printed on paper.",
   "scene": 3,
   "section": "Cycles and additional cards"
  },
  {
